# This repository is a code-only mirror of the local production workspace.
# Runtime media, QA evidence, transactions, credentials, and operator logs stay local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/tools/
!/agent_factory/

# Generated/runtime material inside the tracked code trees.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/*.bak
**/*.bak_*
**/*.tmp
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
**/*token*.json

